te test to be thorough.\n\nTest 3: course path.\n\nURL: `https://linuxacademy.com/cp/courses/view/course/<course_id>` (depends on regex).\n\nWebpage:\n```\nwindow.module = {\"title\": \"Course Title\", \"md_desc\": \"Course description\", \"duration\": \"1:00:00\", \"items\": [\n    \"not-a-dict\",\n    {\"type\": {\"name\": \"Section\", \"slug\": \"section\"}, \"course_name\": \"Chapter One\", \"course_module\": \"mod-1\"},\n    {\"type\": {\"name\": \"Quiz\", \"slug\": \"quiz\"}, \"title\": \"Quiz 1\"},\n    {\"type\": {\"name\": \"Lesson\", \"slug\": \"lesson\"}, \"title\": \"Lesson without URL\"},\n    {\"type\": {\"name\": \"lesson\"}, \"url\": \"/lessons/1\", \"lesson_name\": \"Lesson One\", \"description\": \"<b>Desc One</b>\", \"created_on\": \"2020-02-03T04:05:06Z\", \"duration\": \"10:00\"},\n    {\"type\": {\"slug\": \"lesson\"}, \"url\": \"https://linuxacademy.com/lessons/2\", \"title\": \"Lesson Two\", \"md_desc\": \"MD Two\", \"date\": \"2021-03-04T05:06:07Z\", \"duration\": \"20:00\"},\n    {\"type\": {\"name\": \"lesson\"}, \"url\": \"/lessons/3\", \"title\": \"Lesson Three\", \"text\": \"<i>Text desc</i>\"}\n]};\n```\n\nWait \u2014 for the section item: `type_fields = (type_field('name'), type_field('slug'))`; `'section' in type_fields` \u2014 type_field lowercases. So name 'Section' \u2192 'section'. Good.\n\nFor lesson detection: `'lesson' not in type_fields` \u2192 skip. So a lesson item needs 'lesson' in name.lower() or slug.lower().\n\nFor the lesson without URL: `lesson_url = urljoin(url, item.get('url'))` \u2014 urljoin(base, None) returns None. Good, hits line 188-189.\n\nEntries:\n1. Lesson One: title from lesson_name (since no 'title'), description from clean_html(description) = 'Desc One', timestamp from created_on, duration 600, chapter 'Chapter One', chapter_id 'mod-1', chapter_number 1.\n2. Lesson Two: title 'Lesson Two', description 'MD Two', timestamp from date, duration 1200, chapter 'Chapter Two' (after second section), chapter_id 